icle-title>Early decompressive surgery in malignant infarction of the middlle cerebral artery: a pooled analysis of three randomised controlled trials</article-title><source>Lancet Neurol</source><year>2007</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>215</fpage><lpage>222</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17303527</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1474-4422(07)70036-4</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>